================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
================================================================================

This repository does not vendor third-party runtimes. Two separate things happen
with them, and only the second is redistribution:

  1. At install time, the extension DOWNLOADS each component from its upstream
     publisher onto the user's machine. Crucible is not a distributor there.

  2. GitHub Release artifacts RE-HOST several of these binaries so that install
     is a single fetch. That is redistribution, and the attributions below exist
     for it.

Each component remains under its own license. None is modified.

